  "List the local operations before writing a recurrence: splitting input, scanning for a choice, copying data, and combining results can all contribute. Two half-size calls plus a constant operation behave differently from two half-size calls plus a full scan. The recurrence should describe the procedure you actually have, not merely the number of recursive calls visible in the code.",
