  "The check reports a cycle only when w is on the current DFS stack. The current vertex is reachable from w through tree edges, and the inspected edge returns to w. A complete detector must set active status on entry, finished on exit, and examine all components. Without those surrounding invariants, the string comparison alone does not establish the cycle proof."
